<title>USA: TENNIS-FRIDAY'S RESULTS FROM THE MEN'S CLAY COURT CHAMPIONSHIPS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-FRIDAY'S RESULTS FROM THE MEN'S CLAY COURT CHAMPIONSHIPS.</headline>
<dateline>ORLANDO, Florida 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results at the</p>
<p>$289,250 U.S. Men's Clay Court Championships on Friday (prefix</p>
<p>number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Quarter-finals</p>
<p>1-Michael Chang (U.S.) beat 7-Byron Black (Zimbabwe) 7-5 6-3</p>
<p>6-Chris Woodruff (U.S.) beat 4-Alex O'Brien (U.S.) 6-4 6-7</p>
<p>(5-7) 6-4</p>
<p>5-Jason Stoltenberg (Australia) beat Marcelo Filippini</p>
<p>(Uruguay) 6-7 (3-7) 6-4 6-4</p>
<p>Grant Stafford (South Africa) beat Fernando Meligeni (Brazil)</p>
<p>6-3 6-4</p>
</text>
